/E (While the projected benefit to Australia and our economy from AI shows promise in industries such as medicine, scientific research and development, and advanced computing, encouraging data centre investment in Australia without consideration of the role of big tech companies such as Meta Platforms, inc., OpenAI, and Anthropic, risks further consolidating the harms that they perpetrate against young people. We suggest that any proposed development of AI infrastructure must first demonstrate how it would provide direct benefit to Australia and our people \(especially the communities in close proximity to the data centre\).)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
