/E (As young people, we are concerned specifically with the long-term effects of new infrastructure. While we recognise that the future will be increasingly digitised, we urge the Government to consider that the long-term sustainability of our digital infrastructure relies on that of our environment. Of particular concern is where and how data centres source energy from. If our infrastructure is to be of longitudinal benefit to Australians, the energy used to facilitate digital transformation must be sustainable. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
