166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 341 0 R
/T (Fear of job insecurity: Young people are growing up in an increasingly volatile, uncertain world, and the proliferation of generative-AI is adding to this sense of insecurity. Work provides not only economic security, but also a sense of identity, purpose and social connection. Young people are anxious and fearful about both job insecurity and identity disruption in the face of AI \(noting that the International Monetary Fund estimates that 40% of jobs will be impacted by AI\). )
